SUMMARY:Yoga for Recovery at USARA
DTSTART;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261104T171500
DTEND;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261104T181500
UID:2a2898272ba9c231213d69b45b459048@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Yoga for Recovery is a supportive\, accessible yoga class for 
 anyone impacted by addiction or recovery\, including people in recovery an
 d those affected by the substance use of others. Through gentle movement\,
  breath\, and grounding practices\, this class offers space to reconnect w
 ith the body\, reduce stress\, and support well-being in recovery. No yoga
  experience is needed\, and all recovery pathways are welcome. Free and op
 en to the community. Provided in partnership with USARA. Wednesdays | USAR
 A 125 W 200 S\, #113
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
