SUMMARY:Soup Bowl Fundraiser
DTSTART;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261107T150000
DTEND;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261107T180000
UID:c2985ff4813889e692ac0aec26cef703@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join the Clay Artisans of Moab for the annual Soup Bowl Fundra
 iser benefiting the Wellness Collective! Choose a one-of-a-kind handmade c
 eramic bowl\, enjoy soup\, bread\, and dessert from local restaurants and 
 community partners\, and browse the All-Ceramics Silent Auction. Hosted by
  the Clay Artisans of Moab and sponsored by Desert Sun Ceramics. Proceeds 
 support the Wellness Collective’s free and low-cost community programs. 
 Tickets: www.wellnesscollectivemoab.org
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
