X-SOURCE-ID:wellness_collective
URL:https://wellnesscollectivemoab.org/calendar
SUMMARY:Radical Rest
DTSTART;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261122T140000
DTEND;TZID=MST;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20261122T160000
UID:df9c5524276d6971ca0f25560cd17d90@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Radical Rest is a 2 hour experience of practicing beyond the p
 hysical asana of yoga. Sam (she/her) will guide you through breathwork\, g
 entle asana (a balance of movement and restorative yoga)\, yoga nidra\, an
 d a closing sound bath with crystal bowls\, tuning forks and chimes. This 
 is an invitation to drop in to your body\, reset your nervous system\, foc
 us on your current intentions\, and perhaps set more. Radical Rest is an o
 pportunity to accept yourself where you’re at\, while making room for gr
 owth and self activism. *This workshop might include light group dialogue 
 and optional journaling* Sam is a registered yoga instructor\, licensed ma
 ssage therapist\, and certified movement facilitator with a passion for ho
 lding space for radical self acceptance\, and protecting your inner peace.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
